<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Career Lens · 岗位理解与个人定位</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light;--ink:#192f39;--muted:#576c76;--blue:#155c79;--paper:#fcfaf6;--line:#d8dfdf}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;line-height:1.9;font-size:17px}
main{max-width:920px;margin:auto;padding:60px 44px 80px}a{color:var(--blue);text-underline-offset:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}p{margin:1em 0}h1{font-size:42px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:18px 0 26px}h2{font-size:27px;line-height:1.55;margin:62px 0 22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:28px}h3{font-size:21px;margin:30px 0 10px}strong{font-weight:650}blockquote{border-left:4px solid var(--blue);margin:24px 0;padding:8px 22px;background:#edf3f3}blockquote p{margin:6px 0}.eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--blue);text-transform:uppercase}.subline{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}.lead{font-size:22px;line-height:1.75}.toc{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);padding:12px 0}.toc ul{list-style:none;padding-left:0}.toc li{display:inline-block;margin:0 18px 6px 0}.toc ul ul{display:none}.toc a{text-decoration:none}.task-chain{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:28px 0}.task-chain li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:48px 180px 1fr;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);align-items:start}.task-chain .step{font-family:Georgia,serif;color:var(--blue);font-size:26px;line-height:1.3}.task-chain b{line-height:1.5}.task-chain span:last-child{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted)}.table-wrap{overflow:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0}th{text-align:left;background:#eaf0ef;padding:12px;vertical-align:top}td{padding:14px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}td:first-child{min-width:110px;font-weight:600}ul,ol{padding-left:24px}li{margin:7px 0}code{font-size:.92em}footer{margin-top:56px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:18px}h2,h3{scroll-margin-top:24px}
@media(max-width:600px){body{font-size:16px}main{padding:30px 22px 48px}h1{font-size:30px;letter-spacing:0}h2{font-size:23px;margin-top:42px}.lead{font-size:19px}.task-chain li{grid-template-columns:32px 1fr;gap:8px 12px}.task-chain span:last-child{grid-column:2}.toc li{display:block}.table-wrap table{min-width:620px}}
@media print{@page{size:A4;margin:18mm 17mm}body{background:white;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.7}main{max-width:none;padding:0}h1{font-size:26pt}h2{font-size:17pt;margin-top:22pt;padding-top:13pt;break-after:avoid}h3{font-size:13pt;break-after:avoid}.lead{font-size:12.5pt}.toc{display:none}blockquote,.task-chain,.research-note{break-inside:avoid}table{font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.6}th{background:#eaf0ef!important;print-color-adjust:exact}tr,.task-chain li{break-inside:avoid}.task-chain li{grid-template-columns:30px 120px 1fr;padding:10px 0}.task-chain span:last-child{font-size:10pt}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:underline}.table-wrap{overflow:visible}footer{font-size:9pt}}
</style></head><body><main>{{ body|safe }}<footer>CAREER LENS · 根据招聘职责与本人材料作出的职业分析</footer></main>
<script>document.querySelectorAll('table').forEach(t=>{const w=document.createElement('div');w.className='table-wrap';w.setAttribute('tabindex','0');w.setAttribute('role','region');w.setAttribute('aria-label','对照表，可横向滚动');t.before(w);w.append(t)});</script>
</body></html>
